<http://data.silknow.org/object/b55f9882-3e43-3981-b430-11b17943f097>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of silk.\n\nWoven silk, twill binding.\nStripes:\n[1] white ground with a dark blue meander with diagonal stems forming an irregular lattice. The stems bear buds and rosettes in yellow with white centres, all edged in blue and a central rosette with 4 yellow petals and 4 green or 4 blue outer petals.\n[2] dark blue ground with an isolated flower spray centrally placed in two variations: [a] pink petals, green centre edged in white with green/yellow leaves and [b] the same motif with dark blue petals and centre edged in white with dark blue/yellow leaves. The uppermost leaf points left in [a] and right in [b]\n[3] white ground with an angular dark blue meander of serrated leaves with alternate yellow or green centres bearing buds with either 3 yellow and 2 blue petals or 3 dark blue and 2 yellow petals.\n[4] a repeat of [2] but on a pink ground and the isolated flower spray [a] has blue petals and centres edged in white and leaves and [b] has green petals and dark blue leaves and outlines.\nWarp: pink, dark blue and white silk.\nWeft: yellow, faded pink, white, dark blue and green silk, all Z-twist."@en , "Dress fabric of silk, Iran, 1850-1899"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/1841ea2d-c243-30a2-90fc-b2755401ffa9> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of silk, Iran, 1850-1899"@en , "Dress fabric of silk.\n\nWoven silk, twill binding.\nStripes:\n[1] white ground with a dark blue meander with diagonal stems forming an irregular lattice. The stems bear buds and rosettes in yellow with white centres, all edged in blue and a central rosette with 4 yellow petals and 4 green or 4 blue outer petals.\n[2] dark blue ground with an isolated flower spray centrally placed in two variations: [a] pink petals, green centre edged in white with green/yellow leaves and [b] the same motif with dark blue petals and centre edged in white with dark blue/yellow leaves. The uppermost leaf points left in [a] and right in [b]\n[3] white ground with an angular dark blue meander of serrated leaves with alternate yellow or green centres bearing buds with either 3 yellow and 2 blue petals or 3 dark blue and 2 yellow petals.\n[4] a repeat of [2] but on a pink ground and the isolated flower spray [a] has blue petals and centres edged in white and leaves and [b] has green petals and dark blue leaves and outlines.\nWarp: pink, dark blue and white silk.\nWeft: yellow, faded pink, white, dark blue and green silk, all Z-twist."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/b55f9882-3e43-3981-b430-11b17943f097/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/b55f9882-3e43-3981-b430-11b17943f097/dimension/2> ;
        dc:identifier                  "T.21:107-1955" ;
